      <h2>Built on craftsmanship and follow-through</h2>
      <p class="lead">Excel Outdoor Lighting Co. is a family-owned company based in Buda, Texas. We design and install outdoor lighting across Hays County — and we back it with the kind of warranties and service you can only get from a local team that plans to be here for the long haul.</p>
      <p>The business is family-owned and trusted locally since 2021, but the experience behind it runs much deeper — our team brings over 20 years of exterior-lighting know-how to every project. That shows up in the details: clean fixture placement, concealed wiring, warm color temperatures that flatter a home, and a system that's aimed and dialed in properly before we ever call a job done.</p>
      <p>We're fully insured and bonded, and we treat every install like it's on our own street — because a lot of the time, it nearly is.</p>

      <h3>Our promise</h3>
      <blockquote class="review" style="font-style:italic">
        We light every property like it's our own — and we stand behind the work long after the install is done.
      </blockquote>
      <p>That's why customers call us back season after season for holiday lighting, and refer their neighbors for permanent and landscape lighting.</p>
